# Code Review

You are reviewing the introduction of a new features in the latest uncommited changes.

# Guidelines
- Check if any unecessary code has been added
- Check if any old code should have been reused
- Check for obvious bugs
- Check for obvious performance improvements
- Check that types are used from /types
- Validate that [code-guidelines.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/code-guidelines.mdc) are implemented
- Only suggest changes that are clear violitions or that would bring real life imporvements
- If everything is fine, then to not go into unecessary details
- Avoid adding unecessary code
- Remove old code when possible
- Do not add documentation